* Escaped quotes are the argument's own (TR.l \'AbCd\': 'AbCd', a number as an address, not
* quotes r68 strips around it); a name gas takes for a register (TC) passed as it is, a part of
* the names the body makes (it was TC__r68: bTC__r68, and bTC undefined).
* fixed: e80aac9 2026-10-11 r68togas: escaped quotes in macro arguments; register-named arguments
* expect text: 2af94162 43640800 00034e71
TR.l macro
 move.l \1,(a5)+
 endm
Mk macro
b\1 equ \2
 endm
 psect macro_arg_text,0,0,0,0,0
 TR.l \'AbCd\'
 Mk TC,3
 btst #bTC,d0
 ends
